# Repo Cleanup Policy

## DELETE from GhostRigger root (junk files):
- FIXED_render_*.png (4 files — old debug screenshots)
- NEXT_ITERATION_TASKS.md (28KB — obsolete task list)
- ROADMAP_EXECUTION.md (148KB — execution log, not source)
- diag_animated_skinning.py (one-off diagnostic)
- diagnose_skinning_v2.py (one-off diagnostic)
- full_diagnostic.py (one-off diagnostic)
- live_build_diagnostic.py (one-off diagnostic)
- live_routing_table.json (debug artifact)
- m02aa_01a_validation_proof.md (debug artifact)
- material_analysis_report.md (debug artifact)
- phase_d11_full_diagnostic.py (one-off diagnostic)
- phase_d12_k2_audit.py (one-off diagnostic)
- phase_d12_reopened_audit.py (one-off diagnostic)
- phase_d5_validation.py (one-off diagnostic)
- proof_lmrole.py, proof_real_lmrole.py, proof_lmrole_report.txt, real_lmrole_report.txt
- regression_hardening.py (one-off script)
- d5_validation/ directory
- d6_screenshots/ directory
- d6_validation_results.json
- d7_renders/ directory
- d7v2_renders/ directory
- screenshots/ directory (move 2-3 best to assets/ if needed for README)
- proof_b1_structural/ directory
- audit/ directory (move essential docs to .ghostrigger_reference/docs/)

## DELETE from .ghostrigger_reference/:
- ghostrigger_bundle/books/ (PDF books — 76MB of copyrighted material in git!)
- ghostrigger_bundle/docs/ (duplicates of files already in docs/)
- ghostrigger_bundle/images/ (one contact sheet)
- ghostrigger_bundle/links/ (duplicate manifest)
- ghostrigger_bundle/prompts/ (duplicate of docs/ghostrigger_dev_prompt.md)
- After cleanup, flatten: keep .ghostrigger_reference/docs/ and .ghostrigger_reference/knowledge_base/ only

## DELETE from tests/:
- Any test file that ONLY tests synthetic/mocked data with no connection to real game files
- Keep: test files that test core contracts (vertex_space, render_constants, etc.)
- Keep: test files that test regressions for known bugs

## KEEP (do not delete):
- src/ (all source code)
- tools/model_inspector.py
- main.py
- build.bat
- build_game_templates.py
- pyproject.toml, requirements.txt
- .gitignore
- LICENSE, README.md
- assets/icons/
- GhostRigger-K1-K2.spec
